<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>If we would be built together;</l><l>If related we would be;</l><l>To be fitly framed together;</l><l>Follow brothers constantly.</l><l>Follow brothers for the building;</l><l>Never independent be;</l><l>Follow brothers, be in order,</l><l>Functioning in harmony.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>If we’re for the Lord’s recovery;</l><l>If the earth the Lord’s would be;</l><l>If we would bring in the kingdom;</l><l>Follow churches constantly.</l><l>Follow all the local churches;</l><l>Thus, the kingdom we will see.</l><l>Follow in the churches’ flowing</l><l>For the Lord’s recovery.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We would all be better followers,</l><l>Taking in with joy the Word;</l><l>It enables us to follow</l><l>Brothers, churches, and our Lord.</l><l>Follow Jesus; follow brothers;</l><l>Follow churches in the flow;</l><l>By the Word of God amening</l><l>We can all attain this goal.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
